509 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 322 0 R
/E (Security problems on Indian educational campuses which particularly affect women's hostels have developed into a major problem during the last few years. The NCRB Crime in India Report 2019 documented more than 4 lakh incidents of violence against women throughout the country which demonstrates the urgent requirement for improved monitoring and entrance restriction systems. An outsider entered the hostel premises at night during the 2024 Osmania University Ladies Engineering Hostel incident to steal but he ended up threatening a student and escaped before security personnel arrived. Traditional CCTV systems exhibit operational limits which the incident demonstrated while demonstrating the necessity of using AI-based smart surveillance systems.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
