<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 332 0 R
/T (The IIT Ropar hostel theft incident shows how traditional security methods fail to protect against theft. The offender successfully exploited human trust, lack of verification protocols, and passive surveillance systems to commit large-scale theft without detection. The situation demonstrates an urgent requirement for intelligent security systems which use artificial intelligence to deliver ongoing security protection for educational institutions.)
/E (The IIT Ropar hostel theft incident shows how traditional security methods fail to protect against theft. The offender successfully exploited human trust, lack of verification protocols, and passive surveillance systems to commit large-scale theft without detection. The situation demonstrates an urgent requirement for intelligent security systems which use artificial intelligence to deliver ongoing security protection for educational institutions.)
/Pg 26 0 R
/K [12]
>>
endobj
