717 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 334 0 R
/E (Mr. Sanjay Sharma explained that while most current systems rely on simple motion detection to trigger recording, true AI-based identification is an evolving challenge. He thinks the transition from a lab setting to a busy hostel environment is difficult because:-)
/Pg 28 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
718 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 2088 0 R
/E (Dataset Integrity: He said that training data is the most critical factor; without a diverse dataset, the system will fail in real conditions.)
/Pg 28 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
719 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 2089 0 R
/E (Angle of Approach: He noted that unknown individuals can approach from any angle, requiring the system to be trained on multiple orientations, not just front-facing shots.)
/Pg 28 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
720 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 2090 0 R
/E (Active Avoidance: He thinks that people with malicious intent will actively try to hide their identity, unlike authorized users who cooperate with the system.)
/Pg 28 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
721 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 2091 0 R
/E (Crowd Noise: High-density conditions introduce "noise," making it significantly harder for an algorithm to maintain accuracy.)
/Pg 28 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
722 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 334 0 R
/T (1. REAL-WORLD CHALLENGES IN AI DEPLOYMENT)
/E (1. REAL-WORLD CHALLENGES IN AI DEPLOYMENT)
/Pg 28 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
723 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 334 0 R
/T (2. HARDWARE SETUP VS. SOFTWARE INTELLIGENCE)
/E (2. HARDWARE SETUP VS. SOFTWARE INTELLIGENCE)
/Pg 28 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
724 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 334 0 R
/E (The scientists emphasized that even the best software cannot compensate for a poor physical setup, as system performance depends heavily on input quality. Mr. Sanjay Sharma suggested that cameras should be placed directly in front of entry points, slightly above the gate, rather than at high or angled positions to ensure clear footage. He also advised keeping the system simple in the initial stages, noting that AI models are resource-intensive. Additionally, he highlighted the importance of testing the system in real-world, high-traffic environments to ensure reliability under practical conditions.)
/Pg 28 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
