<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 339 0 R
/E (We also interacted with Chief Auditor, PSPCL, CA Rajan Gupta, to understand the infrastructural and operational considerations involved in deploying large-scale surveillance systems. The discussion highlighted that any continuous monitoring solution must be designed with a strong focus on reliability and practical feasibility. In real-world environments, system performance is highly dependent on factors such as uninterrupted power supply for cameras and processing units, as well as stable network connectivity to support real-time data transmission.)
/Pg 33 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
