/T ( Our Innovation - Camera Geometry: One thing we are doing differently is using math and trigonometry to make cameras smarter. Instead of just guessing, our system calculates the exact ground area a camera sees based on its height and angle. This lets us set "Dynamic Thresholds" so the system knows exactly when an area is too crowded or if someone is where they shouldn't be)
/E ( Our Innovation - Camera Geometry: One thing we are doing differently is using math and trigonometry to make cameras smarter. Instead of just guessing, our system calculates the exact ground area a camera sees based on its height and angle. This lets us set "Dynamic Thresholds" so the system knows exactly when an area is too crowded or if someone is where they shouldn't be)
