/P 366 0 R
/E (Three parameters are tuned beyond YOLO defaults. `classes=[0]` restricts output to persons only , no vehicles, no furniture. `iou=0.70` for non-maximum suppression \(default is 0.45\) prevents YOLO from collapsing two nearby people into a single merged box. `min_area=400` filters out detections too small to track meaningfully.)
/Pg 60 0 R
/K [5]
>>
