<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 368 0 R
/E (The standard form accumulates floating-point errors over time until the covariance matrix becomes negative-definite , mathematically invalid, and practically means the filter starts producing nonsense. The Joseph form is numerically stable regardless of how many updates run. A security camera tracking a guard post at 30 FPS for eight hours accumulates over 860,000 updates. Numerical stability is not a theoretical concern here.)
/Pg 62 0 R
/K [5]
>>
