/E (TENTATIVE tracks don't appear on the dashboard. They have to survive three consecutive frames before being confirmed , this stops momentary noise from ever being displayed as a real person. LOST tracks stay alive for 15 seconds, which is long enough for someone to walk from one camera's coverage zone into another's.)
/Pg 63 0 R
/K [0]
>>
