1164 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 369 0 R
/E (Matching runs as a four-stage cascade. Each stage handles a specific combination of track state and detection confidence, and only unresolved tracks and detections move to the next stage. The cost function for each \(track, detection\) pair is:)
/Pg 63 0 R
/K [1]
>>
