/P 383 0 R
/E (The AI-based multi-camera tracking and re-identification system, although initially built for a hostel setup, can easily be expanded to much larger environments. Since the system is designed for real-time detection, tracking, and maintaining identity across cameras, it can be adapted for campuses, public spaces, and even city-level surveillance. However, scaling it up requires careful planning in terms of infrastructure, computing power, and system integration.)
