1353 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 386 0 R
/E (The system is highly dependent on stable internet connectivity and a reliable power supply for effective operation. In practical scenarios, issues such as network delays, bandwidth limitations, and power outages can disrupt real-time monitoring and impact overall system reliability.)
/Pg 80 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
1354 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
